  1	-- migrate:up
  2	
  3	-- Backfill persisted connector definitions from the legacy `entityLinks` shape
  4	-- to the `attributions` shape the identity-pipeline bridge now reads.
  5	--
  6	-- `feeds_schema` is a JSONB snapshot written at install time and only re-synced
  7	-- for BUNDLED connectors (via the refresh-connector-definitions cron). File- or
  8	-- catalog-installed connectors are never re-synced, so a row written before this
  9	-- migration keeps `eventKinds[kind].entityLinks[]` forever — and the new loader
 10	-- reads only `attributions`, silently dropping all attribution for that install.
 11	-- This converts every such row in place so `entityLinks` disappears from data as
 12	-- well as code, with no read-time compatibility shim.
 13	--
